{"nodes": [{"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_fluxo_fluxo_detalhado", "label": "Fluxo detalhado \u2014 do zero ao audit limpo", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/fluxo.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_fluxo_entrega_dever_casa", "label": "Exemplo: feature entrega-dever-casa", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Exemplo can\u00f4nico do fluxo completo (init --preset lgpd-educacao \u2192 new \u2192 spec com US-001/AC-001/AC-002 \u2192 scaffold \u2192 verify \u2192 audit --ci), incluindo ASM-001 e Q-001 abertas que bloqueiam a promo\u00e7\u00e3o para implementada.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/fluxo.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_fluxo_faixas_paralelas", "label": "Faixas paralelas (worktree + branch + contexto limpo)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "1 faixa = 1 git worktree + 1 branch spec/<feature>-faixa-N + 1 janela de contexto limpa. Tarefas que compartilham arquivo caem na mesma faixa em sequ\u00eancia; tarefa sem Arquivos: roda sozinha ao final. 1 tarefa = 1 commit, merges --no-ff, gate depois de tudo mesclado.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/fluxo.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_fluxo_tabela_de_status", "label": "Tabela de status (onp-spec status)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/fluxo.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_fluxo_integracao_com_ci", "label": "Integra\u00e7\u00e3o com CI", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "O mesmo motor embarcado (commitado junto com a skill) roda no pipeline, ou o pacote npm @onovoprogramador/onp-spec \u2014 o gate no CI \u00e9 id\u00eantico ao gate local.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/fluxo.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_fluxo_por_que_mata_o_vibecoding", "label": "Por que isso mata o vibecoding", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "O agente n\u00e3o consegue dizer 'implementei tudo' e passar batido: crit\u00e9rio sem teste, teste que nunca passou, requisito renomeado (TESTE_ORFAO) e teste pulado (AC_SEM_PROVA) s\u00e3o todos acusados. A prova n\u00e3o \u00e9 a palavra do agente \u2014 \u00e9 o exit code.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/fluxo.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_fluxo_fluxo_detalhado", "target": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_fluxo_entrega_dever_casa", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/fluxo.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_fluxo_fluxo_detalhado", "target": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_fluxo_faixas_paralelas", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/fluxo.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_fluxo_fluxo_detalhado", "target": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_fluxo_tabela_de_status", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/fluxo.md